None

## Hints for Future Agents
Run Cargo with the Rust 1.96.1 toolchain bin directory first on PATH. Use full stock templates as a second check in addition to the small offline fixtures. Muse Glimmer uses reasoning_strength. Its template can already honor an effort instruction in a system message. Beam accepts numeric and labeled effort.

## Codebase Discoveries
The default and tool_use variants can have different templates. Track stock effort support per variant and preserve caller text, whitespace and generation framing. DeepSeek V4.1 has a different effort encoding and is outside this change.

